# Data & Auth

## Supabase

- Client-side: `supabase` from `@/lib/supabase` (anon key)
- Server-side/admin: `supabaseAdmin` (service role key, no session persistence)
- Never expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` to the client

## Data Layer

- **V2 catalog**: query `v2_*` tables via `supabaseAdmin` — see `database-schema` rule; reference `src/app/api/admin/*/v2/` routes
- **Auth/enrollment/payment**: `@/lib/db.ts`, `@/lib/permissions.ts`, `@/lib/stripe` for users, students, `instance_enrollments`, Stripe
- **Deprecated**: do not extend `@/lib/db-v2.ts` (uses old `*_v2` table names)

## Auth

- Central config: `src/auth.ts` (NextAuth v5)
- Session role types: `src/types/next-auth.d.ts`
- Roles: `admin`, `coach`, default user (parent/student)
- Enrollment permissions: `checkEnrollmentPermission()` in `@/lib/permissions`

## Stripe

- Client helpers: `@/lib/stripe`
- Webhooks verify signature with `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`; update enrollment via `@/lib/db` helpers

## Environment

- Secrets in `.env.local` only (gitignored)
- Required vars checked by `scripts/check/check-env-vars.js`
- Do not commit or log secrets
